{"u": "10769969117", "name": "Low Range: Offroad 4x4 [EARLY ACCESS]", "place": "88131802740480", "created": "2026-10-09", "updated": "2026-11-23T01:24:36.241Z", "genre": "Simulation", "subgenre": "Vehicle Sim", "desc": "Get stuck. Get winched out. Make it to the top.\nDrive real offroad trails from Australia and the USA in trucks that sink, slide, bend and break. Solo or with friends.\n\n🗺️ THE TRAILS - 12 stages\n- Rubicon Trail, USA: granite slabs and boulder steps\n- Munja Track, the Kimberley: red dirt and deep river fords\n- Billy Goat Bluff, Victoria: one of the steepest climbs in Australia\n- Pyengana Jeep Track, Tasmania: thick forest mud\n\n🔧 THE TRUCK IS THE GAME\n- Air down your tyres, lock the diffs, drop into low range\n- Mud that remembers: ruts get deeper with every truck on the server\n- Winch off a tree or a friend's bumper\n- Dent it, pop a tyre, run out of fuel: fuel caches are your checkpoints\n- 10 trucks, from old utes to big expedition wagons\n\n📱 Play on phone, tablet, PC or controller\n\n🚧 Early access: new trails and trucks are on the way.\n", "desc_hash": "e8d8ca320a74", "max_players": 20, "vip": false, "price": null, "avatar": "MorphToR15", "visits": 19891176, "favorites": 108313, "creator": {"id": 7429170, "name": "MTBAce Studios", "type": "Group", "verified": false}, "daily": {"2026-11-05": {"updated": "2026-11-05T13:51:24.565Z", "visits": 1443345, "fav": 10991, "up": 5007, "down": 160}, "2026-11-06": {"updated": "2026-11-06T14:56:04.444Z", "visits": 1963096, "fav": 12916, "up": 5748, "down": 194}, "2026-11-07": {"updated": "2026-11-07T12:52:57.477Z", "visits": 2881916, "fav": 17140, "up": 7183, "down": 288}, "2026-11-08": {"updated": "2026-11-08T12:08:56.683Z", "visits": 4073975, "fav": 22989, "up": 9110, "down": 417}, "2026-11-09": {"updated": "2026-11-09T09:50:28.243Z", "visits": 5122239, "fav": 28653, "up": 10896, "down": 530}, "2026-11-10": {"updated": "2026-11-10T17:48:58.909Z", "visits": 6189816, "fav": 34727, "up": 12752, "down"